    <string name="disclosure_title">Accessibility disclosure</string>
    <string name="disclosure_body">AuraMic uses Android\'s Accessibility Service for one purpose only: after you record a voice note, it selects the chat you were in and taps the Send button inside WhatsApp or WhatsApp Business so the note is delivered without extra taps.\n\nIt works only in WhatsApp and WhatsApp Business. It does not read, collect, store or share your messages, contacts or any personal data. Audio is processed on your device.\n\nIt also looks up where WhatsApp\'s own voice button is on screen, so the AuraMic microphone can sit exactly on top of it. It never reads message text.</string>
