    <string name="q_medium">Medium Quality</string>
    <string name="q_medium_desc">Fast and light. Removes most background noise like fans, traffic and room echo, and keeps your voice clear. Your voice note is ready in a moment and uses less battery. Great for everyday chats.</string>
    <string name="q_high">High Quality</string>
    <string name="q_high_desc">Studio-clean sound. Removes almost all background noise, even people talking nearby, and makes your voice rich, balanced and loud enough, like a professionally recorded podcast. Takes a few seconds longer and uses a little more battery.</string>
